      "side": 1,
      "message": "Oh, I see this comes from the other CL (cvd-host-package usage).\nHmm, this works fine today, but I\u0027m worried that we\u0027re adding dependencies(calling AddDependencies) for those \"extra deps\" with our own dep-tag, which deprives the derived class of accessing those dependencies. (e.g. VisitDirectDepsWithTag(..??)).",
